1
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:17,540
Mes grands-parents travaillaient plus que nous, mais ils avaient plus de temps libre.
My grandparents worked more than we do, but they had more free time.

2
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:23,372
C'est vrai que de nos jours, on voyage autant, mais on se repose moins.
It's true that nowadays we travel as much, but we rest less.

3
00:00:23,472 --> 00:00:29,156
Ma grand-mère dit qu'à son époque, les enfants jouaient dehors plus souvent.
My grandmother says that in her day, children played outside more often.

4
00:00:29,256 --> 00:00:34,940
Aujourd'hui, ils passent autant d'heures devant un écran que devant leurs devoirs.
Today they spend as many hours in front of a screen as in front of their homework.

5
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:40,412
Et pourtant, ils savent beaucoup plus de choses que nous à leur âge.
And yet they know many more things than we did at their age.

6
00:00:40,512 --> 00:00:47,708
Chaque génération a ses avantages. Ce n'est ni mieux ni moins bien, c'est différent.
Every generation has its advantages. It's neither better nor worse, it's different.
